# File Structure

## Main Files

- [index.html](mdc:index.html): The main HTML file that defines the UI structure and loads the required scripts and styles.

- [compression.js](mdc:compression.js): The core JavaScript file containing all the compression logic, file handling, and UI interactions.

- [styles.css](mdc:styles.css): Contains all styling rules for the application with a Discord-inspired theme.

- [README.md](mdc:README.md): Documentation for the project, explaining features, usage instructions, and technical details.

## Organization

The project follows a simple structure with all functionality in the main files. Each file has a specific purpose:

- HTML: Structure and content
- JavaScript: Behavior and functionality
- CSS: Appearance and layout

This keeps the codebase simple and easy to understand, with no build process required.
